WEBVTT

00:00:29.007 --> 00:00:30.874
nastanu 100 triljuna stanica,

00:00:30.874 --> 00:00:32.975
se zove rast.

00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:34.629
I rast izgleda jednostavno

00:00:34.629 --> 00:00:35.969
jer kad o njemu razmišljamo,

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.229
uglavnom mislimo kako netko postaje viši

00:00:38.229 --> 00:00:40.377
ili, kasnije u životu, širi,

00:00:40.377 --> 00:00:42.875
ali kod stanica,
rast nije jednostavan.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.324
Podjela stanica je
zamršen kemijski ples

00:00:45.324 --> 00:00:47.955
dijelom individualno,
dijelom grupno motiviran.

00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:50.480
I u susjedstvu od 100 
triljuna stanica,

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.004
ponekad stvari krenu loše.

00:00:53.004 --> 00:00:56.708
Možda stančini set instrukcija, ili DNA

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:57.847
dobije pogrešan zapis,

00:00:57.847 --> 00:00:59.704
što nazivamo mutacijom.

00:00:59.704 --> 00:01:01.562
Večinom stanice 
same pronađu greške